    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ae61a6f433511.38211041\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">A brand-new Hearthstone is available from Talebound, and we've datamined its animation!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/talebound-overview-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Talebound Guide</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_waycrestmannor.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/talebound-end-game-player-power-rewards-venomstones-bonus-rolls-experience-383659\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Talebound Rewards</span></a></div><br><br>One of the rewards from Talebound is <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/item=288912/wood-cursed-hearthstone\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Wood-Cursed Hearthstone\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_10_alchemy_alchemystone_color3.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Wood-Cursed Hearthstone</span></a>, a brand-new Hearthstone.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><video controls=\"\" style=\"width: 800px;\"><source src=\"https://nether.wowhead.com/video-stream/442765-hearthstone?dataEnv=1&amp;locale=0\"></video></div><br><br>This Hearthstone is obtained by completing the <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/ptr/achievement=64465/the-tale-complete\"><img alt=\"The Tale Complete\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_10_alchemy_alchemystone_color3.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">The Tale Complete</span></a> achievement, which requires completing all Tales and the final confrontation. The animation is heavily Drust-themed, with a very shadowy exit after use.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>A brand-new Hearthstone is available from Talebound, and we've datamined its animation!<br /><br />Talebound GuideTalebound Rewards<br /><br />One of the rewards from Talebound is <a href=\"/item=288912/wood-cursed-hearthstone\">Wood-Cursed Hearthstone</a>, a brand-new Hearthstone.<br /><br />This Hearthstone is obtained by completing the <a href=\"/achievement=64465/the-tale-complete\">The Tale Complete</a> achievement, which requires completing all Tales and the final confrontation. The animation is heavily Drust-themed, with a very shadowy exit after use.</noscript>            \n        ",
