    "summary": {
      "en": "Bring your appetite for adventure—this month is all about indulging your sweet side! November’s Trading Post is serving up a sugar rush with the Sweet Tooth theme, ready to add a l...",
      "es": "Traiga su apetito por la aventura: ¡este mes se trata de complacer su lado dulce! El Trading Post de noviembre está sirviendo una fiebre del azúcar con el tema Sweet Tooth, listo para..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ae61b8f05d762.75561048\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced the November Traveler's Log bonus reward, the Motocross Bunmover 4600!<br><br>In this week's WoW Weekly Recap, Blizzard previewed the November Trading Post with a \"<b>Sweet Tooth</b>\" theme. While they didn't provide any of the actual items, they did provide the Bonus Reward for completing the Traveler's Log: the <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=282649/hot-motocross-bunmover-4600\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/8270409.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600</span></a>!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/wow-weekly-recap-wow-forever-talebound-demo-new-shop-decor-packs-383664\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#DAA520;\">Satisfy Your Sweet Tooth in November’s Trading Post</span></h2>\n\n<p>Bring your appetite for adventure—this month is all about indulging your sweet side! November’s Trading Post is serving up a sugar rush with the Sweet Tooth theme, ready to add a little sweetness to your collection. Complete activities to earn Trader’s Tender, and fill your Traveler’s Log to claim this month's bonus reward: the <strong>Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600</strong> mount.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>\"When dessert manufacturing meets speed optimization. Intact bun delivery not guaranteed.\"</em></p>\n\n<aside class=\"gallery\">\n<figure><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/V0NAH7LAMXO21793292371503.png\"><img alt=\"alternate-image-name\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/V0NAH7LAMXO21793292371503.png\"></a>\n\n<figcaption>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520;\"><strong>Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600 Mount</strong></span> (Front)</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<figure><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/K284ZH94Q1VS1793292371758.png\"><img alt=\"alternate-image-name\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/K284ZH94Q1VS1793292371758.png\"></a>\n\n<figcaption>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520;\"><strong>Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600 Mount</strong></span> (Back)</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Visit T&amp;W (Tawney and Wilder) just outside the Mage District in Stormwind, or the Zen’shiri Trading Post next to Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar, to check out the latest items they have available. Players can also visit the Trading Post in the capital cities of Dornogal (The Foregrounds) on the Isle of Dorn and in the renewed <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24243213\" target=\"_blank\">Silvermoon City</a>, where representatives of both Tawney and Wilder and the Zen’shiri Trading Post are open for business.</p>\n\n<p>Champions new to or returning to <em>World of Warcraft</em> and <em>Midnight</em> can <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24131507\" target=\"_blank\">tour the Trading Post</a> to learn everything you need to know, from where to find it to how you can earn additional Trader's Tender through the Traveler's Log.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"image-divider\"></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced the November Traveler's Log bonus reward, the Motocross Bunmover 4600!<br /><br />In this week's WoW Weekly Recap, Blizzard previewed the November Trading Post with a &quot;<b>Sweet Tooth</b>&quot; theme. While they didn't provide any of the actual items, they did provide the Bonus Reward for completing the Traveler's Log: the <a href=\"/item=282649/hot-motocross-bunmover-4600\">Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600</a>!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Blizzard</h2>\n\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#DAA520;\">Satisfy Your Sweet Tooth in November’s Trading Post</span></h2>\n\n<p>Bring your appetite for adventure—this month is all about indulging your sweet side! November’s Trading Post is serving up a sugar rush with the Sweet Tooth theme, ready to add a little sweetness to your collection. Complete activities to earn Trader’s Tender, and fill your Traveler’s Log to claim this month's bonus reward: the <strong>Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600</strong> mount.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>\"When dessert manufacturing meets speed optimization. Intact bun delivery not guaranteed.\"</em></p>\n\n<aside class=\"gallery\">\n<figure><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/V0NAH7LAMXO21793292371503.png\"><img alt=\"alternate-image-name\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/V0NAH7LAMXO21793292371503.png\" /></a>\n\n<figcaption>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520;\"><strong>Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600 Mount</strong></span> (Front)</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<figure><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/K284ZH94Q1VS1793292371758.png\"><img alt=\"alternate-image-name\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/K284ZH94Q1VS1793292371758.png\" /></a>\n\n<figcaption>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520;\"><strong>Hot Motocross Bunmover 4600 Mount</strong></span> (Back)</p>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Visit T&#38;W (Tawney and Wilder) just outside the Mage District in Stormwind, or the Zen’shiri Trading Post next to Grommash Hold in Orgrimmar, to check out the latest items they have available. Players can also visit the Trading Post in the capital cities of Dornogal (The Foregrounds) on the Isle of Dorn and in the renewed <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24243213\" target=\"_blank\">Silvermoon City</a>, where representatives of both Tawney and Wilder and the Zen’shiri Trading Post are open for business.</p>\n\n<p>Champions new to or returning to <em>World of Warcraft</em> and <em>Midnight</em> can <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/24131507\" target=\"_blank\">tour the Trading Post</a> to learn everything you need to know, from where to find it to how you can earn additional Trader's Tender through the Traveler's Log.</p>\n\n<hr class=\"image-divider\" /></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
